 the figure, revealing the intruder to be the plague itself, which then claims every reveller as the lights die and darkness consumes the abbey.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"characters\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"char_the_prince_prospero_d85685e9\",\n      \"canonical_name\": \"the Prince Prospero\",\n      \"aliases\": [\n        \"the mummer\"\n      ],\n      \"role\": null,\n      \"appearance\": null,\n      \"personality\": null,\n      \"voice_guidance\": null,\n      \"descriptions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Prince Prospero is a bold and robust man who leads a group of revellers in a secluded abbey during a plague. He initially reacts with anger and authority when confronted by a masked figure dressed as the Red Death, but later displays fear and rage, ultimately pursuing the intruder before being killed. His actions and reactions shift from commanding to panicked, culminating in his death in the black chamber.\",\n          \"source_position\": 10339,\n          \"chapter_index\": null,\n          \"confidence\": \"llm_refined\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"relationships\": {},\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"statement\": \"Prince Prospero is bold and robust\",\n          \"quote\": \"the prince was a bold and robust man\",\n          \"position\": 11148,\n          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"statement\": \"He reacts with anger and authority to the masked figure\",\n          \"quote\": \"Seize him and unmask him -- that we may know whom we have to hang at sunrise, from the battlements!\",\n          \"position\": 11148,\n          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"statement\": \"He pursues the intruder through the chambers\",\n          \"quote\": \"the Prince Prospero, maddening with rage and the shame of his own momentary cowardice, rushed hurriedly through the six chambers\",\n          \"position\": 12389,\n          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n       